@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 160
title MQ-rust 事务状态机

[*] --> Prepared : Half 落盘 + TxRecord(Prepared)
Prepared --> Committing : Commit / 回查确认 Commit
Prepared --> RolledBack : Rollback / 回查确认 Rollback
Prepared --> TimedOut : 超过 max_tx_age 且策略=rollback
Committing --> Committed : 物化成功 + TxRecord(Committed)
Committing --> Committing : 崩溃恢复重放（幂等）
Committed --> [*]
RolledBack --> [*]
TimedOut --> RolledBack : 执行回滚
TimedOut --> Committed : 人工/对账确认应提交

note right of Committing
  不变式：
  1. Committed 必须有 materialized_offset
  2. Committing 恢复时必须继续物化
  3. Prepared 超时进入 TimedOut
end note
@enduml
